(Question 2 ) :•	Create  use case diagram [10]
An on-demand custom home decor service enables consumers to order personalized furniture pieces or wall art. 
Consumers can choose from various categories, including furniture like chairs, sofas, or tables, and wall art like paintings or posters. 
They can specify details such as materials, colors, and sizes, and for wall art, they can upload custom designs or images. 
To place an order, consumers must create an account and provide their shipping and payment information. Once the order is customized, the system generates a preview and shows the total cost. 
If any required information is missing, such as payment or shipping details, the system prompts the consumer to complete their account. 
After confirming the order, payment is processed, and the production team begins creating the customized piece. 
If any issues arise during production, such as a design mismatch or incorrect size, the consumer is notified to revise their order.
Upon approval of payment, the customized furniture or artwork is produced and shipped. 
The system also tracks material stock, such as wood, fabric, or paints, and when stock levels fall below a threshold, it automatically orders more from suppliers.


